; An automated transaction that generates a must-balance posting re-verifies
; the transaction and rejects it when the posting leaves a residual
; (src/xact.cc:1677-1684, xact_base_t::verify at src/xact.cc:1040-1110).

= /Food/
    Assets:Savings    0.1

2026/01/01 lunch
    Expenses:Food    10.00 USD
    Assets:Cash

test bal -> 1
